    "detailed_description": "Embark on an extraordinary journey with Beyond Solar, an immersive pixel art vertical shooter that thrusts players into a gripping narrative surrounding the mysterious migration of humanity to the desolate expanse of outer space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAssume the role of &quot;Gravity,&quot; a skilled young pilot nurtured within the confines of the space colony &quot;ARD&quot; \u2013 humanity's final sanctuary in the face of Earth's impending demise. For &quot;Gravity,&quot; Earth is no more than a bedtime tale woven throughout his upbringing, until an unexpected distress signal disrupts the tranquility of the supposedly uninhabitable planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis enigmatic signal triggers a profound dilemma within the colony, prompting a pivotal question: Should the remnants of humanity return to Earth, a planet rendered inhospitable by extreme conditions? In response, the colony's leaders opt to entrust the mission to one of their most accomplished young pilots &quot;Gravity&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Gravity, players must navigate through challenging levels, confronting formidable foes and overcoming treacherous obstacles, all while uncovering the truth behind Earth's abandoned state. Will you unravel the mysteries of the great migration and lead humanity back to its roots on planet Earth, or will the void of space become the ultimate frontier for our species?",
    "about_the_game": "Embark on an extraordinary journey with Beyond Solar, an immersive pixel art vertical shooter that thrusts players into a gripping narrative surrounding the mysterious migration of humanity to the desolate expanse of outer space.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAssume the role of &quot;Gravity,&quot; a skilled young pilot nurtured within the confines of the space colony &quot;ARD&quot; \u2013 humanity's final sanctuary in the face of Earth's impending demise. For &quot;Gravity,&quot; Earth is no more than a bedtime tale woven throughout his upbringing, until an unexpected distress signal disrupts the tranquility of the supposedly uninhabitable planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis enigmatic signal triggers a profound dilemma within the colony, prompting a pivotal question: Should the remnants of humanity return to Earth, a planet rendered inhospitable by extreme conditions? In response, the colony's leaders opt to entrust the mission to one of their most accomplished young pilots &quot;Gravity&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs Gravity, players must navigate through challenging levels, confronting formidable foes and overcoming treacherous obstacles, all while uncovering the truth behind Earth's abandoned state. Will you unravel the mysteries of the great migration and lead humanity back to its roots on planet Earth, or will the void of space become the ultimate frontier for our species?",
    "short_description": "Embark on a thrilling bullet hell/SHMUP journey in Beyond Solar. As &quot;Gravity,&quot; a space pilot from the colony ARD, defend humanity's last sanctuary amid Earth's impending doom. Brace yourself for intense pixel art action in a desperate fight for survival.",
